    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Jacqueline Tindi is busy setting up a critical care unit in at the new Kenyatta University Teaching and Referral hospital that will cater for the growing population in Nairobi and Central Kenya. In between dealing with administrative issues, relating to physical resources and building a cohesive team - she remains focused on ensuring the unit is well equipped for patients who will need specialized care.",
